<title>USA: Centris Group Inc names Caporale CFO.</title>
<headline>Centris Group Inc names Caporale CFO.</headline>
<dateline>COSTA MESA, Calif. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Centris Group Inc said it named Charls Caporale senior vice president, chief financial officer and treasurer. He succeeds Mark Burke, who resigned to pursue other interests but will remain a consultant to the company.</p>
<p>Caporale previously served as vice president and chief financial officer of Minet Inc.</p>
